# TraceFlow .gitignore
#
# POLICY (from agent.md): the published repository contains ONLY README.md and
# the actual source. Everything below is intentionally excluded so that the rule
# is enforced mechanically rather than by discipline.
#
# If you ever decide to publish the planning documents, delete the corresponding
# line here. Until then, this file is the single source of truth for the rule.

# --- Internal planning / governance documents: never published ---
plan.md
agent.md
mind.md
review.md
SKILL.state.md
CONTEXT.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

